an class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>合规</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{合规}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">合规</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 含认证审计、合规文件、危废处置与数据清除证书成本，不随处理量线性下降，因此小体量回收厂单位成本天然更高。收益式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为材料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 市场价、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为入料品位、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为实际回收率——<strong>回收厂赚的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘积</strong>，提高前端分选与改善冶金改善同一项收入，应择优投入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三条物理通道</strong>（整机再售/部件回收/材料回收）。收入下限是金属现货价 × 品位，上限受逆向物流成本约束——<strong>瓶颈在收集端而非冶金端</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>拆解深度是优化变量</strong>，最优点通常停在有害件清除 + 高价值模块分离；但<strong>有害部件预拆与数据擦除是合规闸门而非优化项</strong>（WEEE 附件 VII）。</li>\n<li><strong>法规三层</strong>：WEEE 2012/19/EU（收集 65%/85%，回收 85%/80% 等）、巴塞尔 Y49/A1181（2025-01-01 起全线 PIC）、EU 2024/1157（2026-05-21 起主体适用）。</li>\n<li><strong>电池法规 2023/1542</strong> 把回收变成上游采购约束（收集 45%→73%，钴铜铅镍材料回收率 90%→95%、锂 50%→80%，再生含量 2031/2036 强制，电池护照 2027-02-18）；<strong>度量</strong>须区分收集率/回收率/材料回收率，警惕质量平衡与链式监管对再生含量声明的差异。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拆解回收与逆向物流物料回收","id":"拆解回收与逆向物流物料回收"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条通道与收集瓶颈","id":"核心概念-三条通道与收集瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"拆解工程：先拆什么、拆多深","id":"拆解工程-先拆什么-拆多深"},{"level":2,"text":"材料回收冶金：机械分选、火法与湿法","id":"材料回收冶金-机械分选-火法与湿法"},{"level":2,"text":"全球法规地图：WEEE、巴塞尔与废料运输条例","id":"全球法规地图-weee-巴塞尔与废料运输条例"},{"level":2,"text":"电池与关键原材料的闭环要求","id":"电池与关键原材料的闭环要求"},{"level":2,"text":"认证与供应商合规：R2v3 与 e-Stewards","id":"认证与供应商合规-r2v3-与-e-stewards"},{"level":2,"text":"回收度量：三个口径与成本模型","id":"回收度量-三个口径与成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多渠道上架对账与异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/returns-recommerce-refurbishment-resale-circular-economy/resale-channel-pricing/listing-inventory-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"循环经济合规与数字产品护照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/returns-recommerce-refurbishment-resale-circular-economy/recycling-compliance-measurement/circular-economy-compliance"}}